"Generally speaking, you should still be able to use either the Ignition "
"counterpart or Gazebo counterpart for **most things** if you are using "
"Harmonic, due to explicit tick-tocking logic written in the stack. Just note "
"that using the Ignition counterpart will generally cause deprecation "
"warnings to be emitted."
msgstr ""

