#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:181
msgid ""
"The following migration guidelines are just that—guidelines and suggestions "
"for how to get your package migrated, that should cover most general cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:183
msgid ""
"Just keep in mind the overarching goal of replacing every Ignition "
"counterpart (`IGN`, `Ign`, `Ignition`, `ign`, `ignition`) to the Gazebo "
"counterpart (`GZ`, `Gz`, `gz`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:185
msgid "Recommendations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:187
msgid "What might help greatly is to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:189
msgid "Make ample use of regex and `sed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:190
msgid ""
"The migration guide will be giving suggestions for what regex expressions to "
"use, but **always review before executing the replace**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:191
msgid "Pay attention to case!!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:192
msgid ""
"Use an editor to review changes, and source control to allow for easy "
"rollbacks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:193
msgid ""
"Pay attention to compilation warnings/errors, which usually (but not always) "
"give suggestions for what to replace!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:194
msgid ""
"If in doubt, trace the change to changes listed in the [tracking issue]"
"(https://github.com/gazebo-tooling/release-tools/issues/698)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:196
msgid ""
"Also, if you are building the Gazebo stack from source, you should do a "
"clean, fresh rebuild and install. Delete your `build` and `install` "
"directories, and run the build with `--merge-install`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:199
msgid "Gotchas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:201
msgid ""
"Most of the migration effort you should do is mainly finding and replacing "
"instances of Ignition-related terms with the Gazebo-related one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../migration_from_ignition.md:203
msgid ""
"However, here are a lot of edge cases that make it difficult to create a "
"script to handle the migration (leading to errors or bugs), so before the "
"migration steps are suggested, it would be good to know some of these cases."
msgstr ""

